id: pm-0orupq
title: Diagnose native packed-create zero-winner acceptance failures
description: "Native Mac Bun qualification intermittently rejects both same-id create attempts, while the required invariant is one winner and one typed loser. Current assertion hides both rejection causes. Preserve the completed pm-58zon0 guard qualification, expose compact runtime and rejection context, and use the actual evidence to choose any repair. Retain all existing assertions, deadlines and retries."
